         <editorialDecl><p>The footnotes appear to be highly suspect, often in the wrong place with incorrect beta code which may  or may not have been correctly converted, many oddities in presentation that were not initially captured, and incorrect line assignments. Many unusal things were labeled as figures. Milestones were not encoded.</p></editorialDecl>
